  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge Infrastructure Aquaculture Mekong Delta</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nuffic Southeast Asia (SEA) has been tasked by the Agricultural Counsellor for Vietnam to coordinate a needs assessment focused on aquaculture in the Mekong Delta. This effort is part of a broader initiative to foster sustainable aquaculture through cooperation, trade and investment, aligned with the Strategic Partnership Agreements on Sustainable Agriculture and Food Security, Climate Change Adaptation, and the Agricultural Transformation Plan for the Mekong Delta. The assessment will identify vocational and professional capacity needs, focusing on Technical and Vocational Education and Training and university-level education, and map opportunities for the Dutch private sector to step in and fill these gaps.</narrative>
  </description>
